## Troubleshooting

- `./status.sh <id>` shows why an instance failed in `message`.
- `docker compose logs dlstreamer-pipeline-server` shows the server log.
- An instance that finishes at a very high FPS with no events in `objects` did not run
  inference; check the log for `exception occured during inference`.
